ault watchdog is 120s, a 20-second gap during reasoning should never trip it. You must have customized something to 20s!\\\"\",[[0,132,[[null,null,null,null,1]]]]]]]]]]]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[null,[null,3,\"2. Why Did Your Client Log 20s Without You Customizing Anything?\",[[27,30,[[null,null,null,null,3]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"If you didn't customize any timer parameters, why did the log say:\"]],[null,null,null,[\"[Watchdog] Socket idle for 20s. Refreshing connection...\\n\",\"text\"]],[null,[null,0,\"There are two reasons this happens out-of-the-box in the codebase:\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"The Fallback / Minimum Cap in client.py:\\nIn the stream chunk loop around client.py:1570, the timeout evaluated before candidates arrive is computed dynamically:\",[[30,39,[[null,null,null,null,3]]],[0,40,[[null,null,null,null,2]]],[73,87,[[null,null,null,null,3]]]]]],[null,null,null,[\"stall_threshold \\u003d min(self.timeout, self.watchdog_timeout)\\n\",\"python\"]],[null,[null,0,\"Or, depending on the internal network wrapper / curl-cffi transport settings, when is_thinking is False, the loop falls back to an initial chunk arrival threshold / socket idle check, which defaults to 20 seconds (or 1\",[[83,94,[[null,null,null,null,3]]],[98,103,[[null,null,null,null,3]]],[131,182,[[null,null,null,null,2]]],[202,212,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]]],1]]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"3.8 Flash\",true,[[[[1004,\"Longer\",5,null,[\"expand\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/expand/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1005,\"Shorter\",6,null,[\"compress\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/compress/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1003,\"Personalize\",3,null,[\"personal_recommendations\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/personal_recommendations/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1001,\"Try again\",1,null,[\"refresh\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/refresh/default/24px.svg\",null,true]]]]],null,2,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,1]"]]
