 of server-side computation before flushing the first delta.\",[[0,11,[[null,null,null,null,3]]],[27,32,[[null,null,null,null,3]]],[0,33,[[null,null,null,null,2]]],[39,61,[[null,null,null,null,3]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Because is_thinking is False at start, the watchdog cannot distinguish between an abandoned TCP connection and server-side reasoning.\",[[8,19,[[null,null,null,null,3]]],[23,28,[[null,null,null,null,3]]],[52,132,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Even if the watchdog were 120 seconds, complex chain-of-thought prompts can hit or exceed long pauses, and any tighter watchdog or transient stall check will prematurely kill the connection.\"]]]]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[null,[null,3,\"Suggested Reply to Set the Record Straight\"]],[null,[null,0,\"You can reply to @luuquangvu directly addressing both the default timer behavior and the state\",[[17,28,[[null,null,null,null,3]]]]]]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"3.8 Flash\",true,[[[[1004,\"Longer\",5,null,[\"expand\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/expand/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1005,\"Shorter\",6,null,[\"compress\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/compress/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1003,\"Personalize\",3,null,[\"personal_recommendations\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/personal_recommendations/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1001,\"Try again\",1,null,[\"refresh\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/refresh/default/24px.svg\",null,true]]]]],null,2,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,1]"]]
